{
  "$comment": "pallastradeharness 机读架构（Batch C / C04）。结构与 templates/constitution/architecture.schema.json 对齐；`dependency_rules.deny` 由 bin/constitution-compliance.mjs 强制（重大 violation → Blocking Finding）。",
  "schema_version": "1.0",
